{"metadata":{"slug":[{"Plain":"CW复形"},0],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"title":[{"Plain":"CW 复形"},2],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>观念</h2>\n<p>CW 复形是通过一系列粘贴胞腔操作得到的空间:\n$$\r\nX = \\operatorname{colim}(X_0\\to X_1\\to\\cdots),\r\n$$\n每个嵌入 $X_n\\to X_{n+1}$ 来自拓扑空间范畴中的"},{"Local":{"url":"推出","text":"推出"}},{"Plain":"\n$$\r\n\\begin{CD}\r\n\\bigcup_I S^n @&gt;&gt;&gt; X_n \\\\\r\n@VVV @VVV \\\\\r\n\\bigcup_I D^{n+1} @&gt;&gt;&gt; X_{n+1}.\r\n\\end{CD}\r\n$$</p>\n<p>CW 复形在"},{"Local":{"url":"同伦论","text":"同伦论"}},{"Plain":"上的意义是其对应的"},{"Local":{"url":"生象","text":"生象"}},{"Plain":" $X$ 自动带有一个"},{"Local":{"url":"滤过","text":"滤过"}},{"Plain":"\n$$\r\nX_0 \\to X_1 \\to X_2\\to \\cdots,\r\n$$\n其逐项"},{"Local":{"url":"余纤维列","text":"余纤维"}},{"Plain":"为球面束 (球面的一点并).\n$$\r\n\\begin{CD}\r\nI\\times S^n @&gt;&gt;&gt; X_n @&gt;&gt;&gt; * \\\\\r\n@VVV @VVV @VVV \\\\\r\nI @&gt;&gt;&gt; X_{n+1} @&gt;&gt;&gt; \\bigvee_I S^{n+1}\r\n\\end{CD}\r\n$$</p>\n"}]}}